# FictionBook Editor Next notices

FictionBook Editor Next is a continuation of FictionBook Editor.

The project incorporates and modifies code originating in the historical
[SeNS FictionBook Editor repository](https://github.com/sensboston/fictionbookeditor).
The [evpobr fork](https://github.com/evpobr/fictionbookeditor) was also used
as a reference for selected historical changes.  Copyright notices retained
in source files and resources identify the original authors and must remain
with their respective works.

This repository and its release packages also include third-party components.
Their versions, purposes, upstream sources, and licenses are listed in
[THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md](THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).  The corresponding license
texts are included in release packages under `THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES`.
